      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Physbones have extra steps because they actually work well.  Your old avatars being badly made isn't a valid usecase for anything.  Take the time to actually learn the new tools available, because they're MUCH better.\n\nDynamic Bones are also an external package, which is completely unreasonable to ask a developer to rely on for their own use.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
