      "value": "@{6985912e4e32484d295f493a|full_name} I'm not sure, I've only heard people talk about dynamicbones and VRC's PhysBones. \n\nWhatever you're talking about I'm having trouble tracking down. https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/tools/physics/physicalbone-54751 6 reviews and I think one of them mistook the product for vrchat physbones. I'd guess no converter exists for that one",
